PROJECT {{project}}

TARGET {{target}}

DATABASE {{database}}

AUTH JWT

MODEL User
    name STRING
    email STRING UNIQUE
    password STRING

MODEL Product
    name STRING
    sku STRING UNIQUE
    price_cents INTEGER
    active BOOLEAN OPTIONAL

MODEL Order
    status STRING
    total_cents INTEGER
    placed_on DATE

RELATION User HAS_MANY Order
RELATION Product HAS_MANY Order

VALIDATE email REQUIRED EMAIL
VALIDATE password REQUIRED MIN 8
VALIDATE sku REQUIRED MAX 64
VALIDATE price_cents MIN 0
VALIDATE total_cents MIN 0

ROUTE GET /products
ROUTE GET /products/{id}
ROUTE POST /products
ROUTE PATCH /products/{id}
ROUTE GET /orders PROTECTED
ROUTE GET /orders/{id} PROTECTED
ROUTE POST /orders
ROUTE GET /users/{id}/orders PROTECTED
